#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_translation_consensus_website.field_ai_translation_wizard__scope
msgid ""
"A whole website creates one rule for every kind of content it has: pages, "
"menus, blogs, forums, shop products and categories and so on, depending on "
"what is installed."
msgstr ""
"Eine ganze Webseite legt für jede Art von Inhalt eine eigene Regel an: "
"Seiten, Menüs, Blogs, Foren, Shop-Produkte und -Kategorien und so weiter, je"
" nachdem, was installiert ist."

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:ai_translation_consensus_website.selection__ai_translation_wizard__scope__website
msgid "A whole website with everything on it"
msgstr "Eine ganze Webseite mit allem, was darauf ist"

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#: model:ir.model,name:ai_translation_consensus_website.model_ai_translation_wizard
msgid "AI translation: start wizard"
msgstr "KI-Übersetzung: Startassistent"

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ai_translation_consensus_website/models/ai_translation_wizard.py:0
msgid "Choose a website and at least one kind of content."
msgstr "Wählen Sie eine Webseite und mindestens eine Art von Inhalt."

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ai_translation_consensus_website/models/ai_translation_wizard.py:0
msgid "Choose at least one target language other than the source language."
msgstr ""
"Wählen Sie mindestens eine Zielsprache, die nicht die Quellsprache ist."

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ai_translation_consensus_website/models/ai_translation_wizard.py:0
msgid "Choose the source language."
msgstr "Wählen Sie die Quellsprache."

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ai_translation_consensus_website/models/ai_translation_wizard.py:0
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ai_translation_consensus_website.field_ai_translation_wizard__site_model_ids
msgid "Kinds of content"
msgstr "Arten von Inhalt"

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:ai_translation_consensus_website.selection__ai_translation_wizard__scope__record
msgid "One kind of record (e.g. only blog posts)"
msgstr "Eine Art von Datensatz (z. B. nur Blogbeiträge)"

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_translation_consensus_website.field_ai_translation_wizard__site_model_ids
msgid ""
"One rule is created for each of these. Remove what you do not want "
"translated."
msgstr ""
"Für jeden Eintrag wird eine Regel angelegt. Entfernen Sie, was nicht "
"übersetzt werden soll."

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ai_translation_consensus_website.field_ai_translation_wizard__scope
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "Umfang"

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ai_translation_consensus_website.view_ai_translation_wizard_form_website
msgid "Suggest the content of the website"
msgstr "Inhalte der Webseite vorschlagen"

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ai_translation_consensus_website/models/ai_translation_wizard.py:0
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ai_translation_consensus_website.field_ai_translation_wizard__website_id
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Webseite"

#. module: ai_translation_consensus_website
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/ai_translation_consensus_website/models/ai_translation_wizard.py:0
msgid "Website %(site)s"
msgstr "Webseite %(site)s"
